    },
    {
      "id": "blk_0ef8cb3287",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The single validation point for every built-in backend URL. Provider constructors and settings:set IPC enforce http/https only, no URL credentials, and loopback hosts only \u2014 localhost, 127.0.0.0/8, and ::1. IPv6 unspecified ::, 0.0.0.0, and lookalike DNS names are rejected; redirects are refused, so built-in model requests cannot be redirected off loopback."
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8fc03c9899",
      "type": "heading",
      "content": "Key items",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_2afb15e0ab",
      "type": "field",
      "content": "Validates + normalizes a backend base URL, throwing actionable errors.",
      "meta": {
        "name": "loopbackBase(raw, label)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_848993b1b9",
      "type": "field",
      "content": "fetch option (redirect: \"error\") both providers pass so a redirect can never bounce model traffic off the loopback.",
      "meta": {
        "name": "NO_REDIRECT"
      }
    }
